ace\uff08dot1q encap / VRF RIF / \u547d\u540d\u898f\u5247\uff09 \u2014 \u7269\u7406 port \u307e\u305f\u306f PortChannel \u306b . \u4ed8\u304d\u306e 802.1Q encap sub-interface \u3092\u4f5c\u6210\u3057\u3001VRF binding \u3057\u305f L3 router interface\uff08RIF\uff09\u3068\u3057\u3066\u4f7f\u3046\u2026", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/sonic-sub-port-interface-high-level-design.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T03:57:03+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T22:19:06+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design/", "title": "SSD \u30d8\u30eb\u30b9\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\uff08show platform ssdhealth + ssdutil \u30d7\u30e9\u30b0\u30a4\u30f3\uff09", "content_html": "SSD \u30d8\u30eb\u30b9\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\uff08show platform ssdhealth + ssdutil \u30d7\u30e9\u30b0\u30a4\u30f3\uff09 \u2014 SONiC \u304c\u52d5\u304f NOS \u306f\u7d44\u307f\u8fbc\u307f SSD / mSATA \u306b\u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u307f\u3092\u884c\u3046\u305f\u3081\u3001\u30b9\u30c8\u30ec\u30fc\u30b8\u306e\u5bff\u547d\u3068\u5065\u5168\u6027\u3092\u904b\u7528\u8005\u304c\u628a\u63e1\u3067\u304d\u308b \u5fc5\u8981\u304c\u3042\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/ssdhealth-design.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T03:57:03+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T14:13:02+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/categories/mib-snmp/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/categories/mib-snmp/", "title": "MIB / SNMP \u95a2\u9023", "content_html": "SONiC \u306e SNMP \u30a8\u30fc\u30b8\u30a7\u30f3\u30c8\u306f Net-SNMP + sonic_ax_impl (AgentX subagent) \u3067\u69cb\u6210\u3055\u308c\u3001snmpd \u304c\u6a19\u6e96 MIB \u3092\u63d0\u4f9b\u3057\u3001Python \u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u306e subagent \u304c\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8 / \u30a4\u30f3\u30bf\u30d5\u30a7\u30fc\u30b9 / \u7269\u7406\u30a8\u30f3\u30c6\u30a3\u30c6\u30a3 / \u30bb\u30f3\u30b5\u30fc / \u30c8\u30e9\u30f3\u30b7\u30fc\u30d0\u7b49\u306e SONiC \u56fa\u6709 MIB \u3092\u5b9f\u88c5\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/categories/mib-snmp.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T03:57:03+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T06:47:34+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/byte-packet-rates-port-utilization-in-sonic/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/byte-packet-rates-port-utilization-in-sonic/", "title": "\u30d0\u30a4\u30c8/\u30d1\u30b1\u30c3\u30c8\u30ec\u30fc\u30c8\u3068\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u4f7f\u7528\u7387\uff08RATES \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb + EMA\uff09", "content_html": "\u30d0\u30a4\u30c8/\u30d1\u30b1\u30c3\u30c8\u30ec\u30fc\u30c8\u3068\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u4f7f\u7528\u7387\uff08RATES \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb + EMA\uff09 \u2014 portstat / intfstat \u304c\u8868\u793a\u3059\u308b RX_BPS / RX_PPS / RX_UTIL \u7b49\u3092\u3001RATES \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u3068\u6307\u6570\u79fb\u52d5\u5e73\u5747\uff08EMA\uff09\u3067\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30bf\u96c6\u7d04\u3059\u308b\u4ed5\u7d44\u307f\u3092\u89e3\u8aac\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/internals/byte-packet-rates-port-utilization-in-sonic.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T03:57:03+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T13:51:03+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "title": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary)", "content_html": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary) \u2014 SONiC NOS \u3067\u983b\u51fa\u3059\u308b\u56fa\u6709\u7528\u8a9e\u30fb\u7565\u8a9e\u30fb\u30b3\u30f3\u30dd\u30fc\u30cd\u30f3\u30c8\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3\u540d\u3092\u3001\u30a2\u30eb\u30d5\u30a1\u30d9\u30c3\u30c8\u9806\u306b\u6574\u7406\u3057\u305f\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6\u3067\u3059\u3002\u5404\u30a8\u30f3\u30c8\u30ea\u306f\u300c\u7528\u8a9e / \u7565\u79f0 / \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u8a33 / \u7c21\u6f54\u306a\u8aac\u660e / \u95a2\u9023\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u300d\u306e\u5f62\u5f0f\u3067\u8a18\u8f09\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/glossary.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T03:57:03+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T18:14:52+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/config-vxlan/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/config-vxlan/", "title": "config vxlan \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9", "content_html": "config vxlan \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9 \u2014 config vxlan \u306f VXLAN VTEP (VXLAN_TUNNEL)\u3001EVPN NVO (VXLAN_EVPN_NVO)\u3001\u304a\u3088\u3073 VLAN-VNI \u30de\u30c3\u30d4\u30f3\u30b0 (VXLAN_TUNNEL_MAP) \u3092\u7ba1\u7406\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/cli/config-vxlan.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T03:57:03+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T17:52:29+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/telemetry-dialout-not-sending/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/telemetry-dialout-not-sending/", "title": "Telemetry \u304c\u9001\u4fe1\u3055\u308c\u306a\u3044 (gNMI dial-out)", "content_html": "Runbook: gNMI dial-out \u304c collector \u306b\u5c4a\u304b\u306a\u3044\u5834\u5408\u306e\u5207\u308a\u5206\u3051\u3002TELEMETRY_CLIENT \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb (Global / DestinationGroup_<name> / Subscription_<name>) \u3068 TLS / L3 \u3092\u78ba\u8a8d\u3059\u308b\u624b\u9806\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/runbooks/telemetry-dialout-not-sending.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T03:57:03+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T07:06:51+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/verification/discrepancy-index/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/verification/discrepancy-index/", "title": "HLD \u3068\u5b9f\u88c5\u306e\u4e56\u96e2 \u4e00\u89a7\uff08discrepancy-index\uff09", "content_html": "HLD \u3068\u5b9f\u88c5\u306e\u4e56\u96e2 \u4e00\u89a7\uff08discrepancy-index\uff09 \u2014 verification: discrepancy-found \u304c\u4ed8\u3044\u305f\u5168\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3092 monitor subtype \u5225\u306b\u5206\u985e\u3057\u305f\u4e00\u89a7\u3002meta/scripts/gen_discrepancy_index.py \u3067\u751f\u6210\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/verification/discrepancy-index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T03:57:03+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T07:19:44+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-loopback-interface/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-loopback-interface/", "title": "sonic-loopback-interface YANG", "content_html": "sonic-loopback-interface YANG \u2014 Loopback interface configuration for virtual interfaces used as router IDs and service IPs", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/yang/sonic-loopback-interface.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T03:57:03+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T19:33:01+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/multiple-spanning-tree-protocol/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/multiple-spanning-tree-protocol/", "title": "Multiple Spanning Tree Protocol (MSTP) on SONiC", "content_html": "SONiC \u306e MSTP (IEEE 802.1Q-2014) \u30b5\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u3002stpmgrd / stpd \u3068 STP_MST* \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u3001CIST / MSTI\u3001MST Region \u306e\u6c7a\u307e\u308a\u65b9\u3001SAI \u30de\u30c3\u30d4\u30f3\u30b0\u3001\u30e2\u30fc\u30c9\u5207\u66ff\u6642\u306e\u30c8\u30dd\u30ed\u30b8\u63fa\u308c\u307e\u3067\u3092 \u5b9f\u88c5\u88cf\u53d6\u308a\u4ed8\u304d\u3067\u6574\u7406\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/switching/multiple-spanning-tree-protocol.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T03:57:03+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T19:25:18+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/sonic-ip-lag-incremental-update/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/sonic-ip-lag-incremental-update/", "title": "IP / LAG / MTU \u306e Incremental Update\uff08portmgrd / intfmgrd / teammgrd \u5206\u62c5\uff09", "content_html": "SONiC \u306e port / IP / LAG / MTU \u3092 CONFIG_DB \u304b\u3089 incremental \u306b\u6d41\u3059\u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u3068\u3001portmgrd / intfmgrd / teammgrd \u306e\u8cac\u52d9\u5206\u62c5\u3092\u89e3\u8aac\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/switching/sonic-ip-lag-incremental-update.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T03:57:03+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T14:30:50+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/sonic-dynamic-port-breakout-feature-high-level-design/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/sonic-dynamic-port-breakout-feature-high-level-design/", "title": "\u52d5\u7684\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u30d6\u30ec\u30a4\u30af\u30a2\u30a6\u30c8\uff08dynamic port breakout\u30fblanes / interface\u518d\u69cb\u6210\uff09", "content_html": "\u52d5\u7684\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u30d6\u30ec\u30a4\u30af\u30a2\u30a6\u30c8\uff08dynamic port breakout\u30fblanes / interface\u518d\u69cb\u6210\uff09 \u2014 1 \u3064\u306e\u7269\u7406 cage\uff08QSFP-DD \u7b49\uff09\u3092 \u8907\u6570\u306e\u8ad6\u7406 port \u306b\u5207\u308a\u5206\u3051\u308b / 1 \u3064\u306b\u623b\u3059 \u64cd\u4f5c\u3092\u3001reload \u4e0d\u8981\u30fb\u7a3c\u50cd\u4e2d\u306e SONiC \u3067 \u884c\u3048\u308b\u3088\u3046\u306b\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/system/sonic-dynamic-port-breakout-feature-high-level-design.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T03:57:03+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T01:58:16+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/01-overview/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/01-overview/", "title": "SONiC \u5168\u4f53\u50cf\u3068\u8a2d\u5b9a\u57fa\u76e4", "content_html": "SONiC \u5168\u4f53\u50cf\u3068\u8a2d\u5b9a\u57fa\u76e4 \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u7ae0\u306f\u3001SONiC \u3092\u8aad\u3080\u3068\u304d\u306b\u6700\u521d\u306b\u6df7\u4e71\u3057\u3084\u3059\u3044\u300c\u8a2d\u5b9a\u306f\u3069\u3053\u304b\u3089\u5165\u308b\u306e\u304b\u300d\u300cRedis DB \u306f\u4f55\u3092\u5206\u62c5\u3059\u308b\u306e\u304b\u300d\u300c\u5909\u66f4\u306f\u3069\u3053\u307e\u3067\u5b89\u5168\u306b\u623b\u305b\u308b\u306e\u304b\u300d\u3092\u3001HLD \u5358\u4f4d\u3067\u306f\u306a\u304f\u8aad\u8005\u306e\u8cea\u554f\u9806\u306b\u4e26\u3079\u76f4\u3057\u305f\u5165\u53e3\u3067\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/01-overview/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T03:57:03+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T10:43:09+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/01-overview/setup/", 